  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in the wild beauty of nature with this custom quilt from Jeminise. Featuring a striking geometric mosaic wolf head illustration, this quilt brings both western traditional style and cozy warmth to your home decor. Perfect for snuggling up on the sofa while watching your favorite shows, reading a book, or taking on outdoor camping trips and picnics, it serves as a versatile and thoughtful gift for animal lovers, family, and friends on any occasion.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Easily personalize this quilt with custom name text input to create a truly unique and meaningful gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Wildlife Design:</strong> Features a beautifully designed Indian Wolf theme with geometric mosaic patterns.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from a soft, breathable, and durable blend of polyester and cotton fabric that keeps you cool in summer and warm in winter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in multiple size options including Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Components:</strong> Complete your bedding set with an optional addition of 2 matching pillowcases (20''x30'').</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Fully machine washable in cold water separately, and quick to air dry without heat.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Indian Wolf 02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Native</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw, Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
